<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-right: 20px; padding-bottom: 16px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">Join Flywire for an <strong>advanced</strong> training course designed to deepen your expertise in payment security and PCI DSS compliance, led by <strong>Dave Neild, Head of Consultancy UK, Flywire.</strong> This course builds upon our Payment Security Foundation course (<strong>we would ask that you attend the <a href="https://www.flywire.com/trainings/uk/payment-security?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter" style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><u>Foundation course</u></span></a> first</strong>).&nbsp;This session, tailored for UK higher education institutions, is ideal for team members managing payment security, IT staff, internal auditors, and those pursuing PCI ISA certification. Learn sector-specific strategies to implement and manage effective payment security approaches.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
